1
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,640
可以朝铁锅的表面泼一点水
You can be sure the wok is at the correct temperature

2
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,340
水滴突然会跳起舞来
by sprinkling water on the surface.

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,840
然后它就蒸发掉了。
The droplets should dance before evaporating.

4
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,080
跳的是芭蕾还是伦巴？
Yes,ballet or rumba?

5
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,660
完美
Perfecto!

6
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,460
爸爸，我们有个建议
Hey dad,look. We got a deal for you.

7
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,460
让店里送馅饼来吧，钱我们来付。
If you'll just order pizza we'll pay for it.

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,180
要双层馅的。
Two toppings!

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,900
你们俩的意思就是你们的老爸没有能力
Are you guys saying that you have no faith in your old dad's ability

10
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,640
做中国菜？
to cook a simple Chinese dinner?

11
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,380
是这样。
Yep!

12
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:30,720
亲爱的。孩子们。
Hi honey!

13
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:31,280
妈妈。
Hi mum

14
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,340
什么着火了？
Hi guys. What's burning?

15
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:35,240
我！
Me.

16
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,480
谁要是对我的烹调手艺再说三道四的，
If anyone says one more thing about my cooking,

17
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,380
我就甩手不干了。
I may just forget the whole thing.

18
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,690
可是你。
Hey (mouth covered up)

19
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:40,960
没有人再说你一个字。
No one's going to say a word.

20
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:42,540
今天做什么吃的？
What are we going to have?

21
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,360
是牛肉泥。
Packed beef.

22
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:45,480
是吗？
Yum.

23
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,300
对不起，我晚了，我在安妮家。
Sorry I'm late. I was over at Annie's.

24
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,540
是你的新朋友？
Oh your new friend?

25
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:51,440
Carol，我没有见过你穿过这件衣服。
Oh Carol,I don't remember that sweater.

26
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,440
对，这不是我的，是安妮借给我的。
Oh! No! It's not mine. It's Annie's. She loaned it to me.

27
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:58,050
噢，快叫警察，书呆子赶时髦了。
Oh call the nerd police. She's out of uniform again.

28
00:00:58,050 --> 00:00:59,910
Mike!

29
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:00,010
Mike！

30
00:01:00,010 --> 00:01:01,570
你化过妆了吗？
Are you wearing make up?

31
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:06,240
就擦了点底粉香粉胭脂口红眼影什么的。
Oh just a little base,powder,blush,lipstick,mascara and eye liner.

32
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,200
安妮的？
Annie's?

33
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,540
她说只要色彩运用得我会显得很漂亮。
Yeah. She says with the right color and shading,I have a beautiful face.

34
00:01:12,830 --> 00:01:14,780
你知道，她是对的。
Oh you know,she's right.

35
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:18,420
Mike，你省着点去取笑你那些朋友吧，
Mike,shut up! You don't see me making fun of your friends.

36
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:20,040
尤其是说话带吞音的。
Even the ones that drool.

37
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:27,330
好了，孩子们，吃一顿美餐以后火气就全熄灭了。
You guys will be a little less hostile after some crispy friend duck lips.

38
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:32,690
幸亏今晚我没有时间和他纠缠不清。
I'm just glad that I won't be around here with Him tonight.

39
00:01:32,690 --> 00:01:33,100
哦？
Oh?

40
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:35,020
安妮和我准备出去，如果可以的话。
Yeah. Annie and I are going out. If that's Ok?

41
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:39,360
Carol，你和朋友出去之前总是先向我们介绍的。
Well Carol,usually we know your friends before you go out with them.

42
00:01:40,630 --> 00:01:41,520
这有什么好介绍的，她是啦啦队长，
Well what's to know. She's a cheerleader;

43
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,220
是戏剧组的，非常风趣，人缘也很好。
she's on the drama club,very funny and very popular.

44
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:46,280
那她为什么老缠着你不放？
So what's she hanging around with you for?

45
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:49,840
Mike!

46
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:49,940
Mike！

47
00:01:49,940 --> 00:01:50,440
说话的是他！不是我。
Hey,I didn't say it. He did.

48
00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:52,140
可口气挺象你。
Sorry,it sounded like you.

49
00:01:53,450 --> 00:01:54,900
我可以走了吗？
So is it Ok?

50
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:55,880
你们打算去哪？
Where will you be going?

51
00:01:57,100 --> 00:02:00,270
去买耳环，我的耳朵刚穿了眼。我能走了吗？
Shopping for ear rings,since I just got my ears pierced.

52
00:02:00,270 --> 00:02:01,450
哦！
Oh!

53
00:02:01,450 --> 00:02:02,870
好了么？
So is it Ok?

54
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:05,360
当然能，不过晚上回家当心点。
Sure. Just be careful walking after dark.

55
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,040
噢，放心，我们不走路，
Oh don't worry. We won't be walking.

56
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,980
安妮自己开车。
Annie drives.

57
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:12,020
安妮自己开车？
Annie drives.

58
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:13,740
听见了。
I heard.

59
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:17,100
顺便让她给我带几个汉堡包好吗？
Hey do you think she could pick some burgers up for us on the way over.

60
00:02:18,630 --> 00:03:25,630
-= Subripped by Susie Shi =-       2007.07.22

61
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:28,370
Carol穿耳朵的事应该是我带她去，
I was going to take Carol to get her ears pierced.

62
00:03:29,030 --> 00:03:30,190
就给她穿一只。
At least one ear.

63
00:03:31,250 --> 00:03:33,190
好了，亲爱的，要是能让你高兴，
Well honey. If it makes you feel any better,

64
00:03:33,250 --> 00:03:34,730
你该带我去穿我的耳朵。
you can take me to get my ears pierced.

65
00:03:36,530 --> 00:03:37,950
噢，我没开玩笑，Jason。
I'm serious Jason.

66
00:03:38,330 --> 00:03:40,850
可是听你的口气
Well what I'm hearing is that uh..

67
00:03:40,850 --> 00:03:42,550
我总觉得你之所以不愉快是因为
I think you're a little bothered by the fact that

68
00:03:43,670 --> 00:03:46,090
Carol交了个对她很有点影响力的朋友。
Carol is actually making a friend who has some real influence on her.

69
00:03:46,090 --> 00:03:48,050
这话你可说错了，大夫。
How wrong you are doctor.

70
00:03:48,370 --> 00:03:49,950
我希望她的朋友越多越好，
I want Carol to have plenty of friends.

71
00:03:49,990 --> 00:03:51,750
但是不能够交个不正经的。
I just wish she'd pick someone who wasn't a slut.

72
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,710
行了，Maggie，
Come on Maggie.

73
00:03:56,770 --> 00:03:58,450
可是那姑娘你还没有见过呢。
You haven't even met the little tramp.

74
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:04,030
她把Carol都打扮得成公主了。你还为她辩护。
You're defending a girl who makes our daughter up to look like Prince.

75
00:04:05,710 --> 00:04:07,330
公主不是挺受欢迎吗？
Prince is very popular.

76
00:04:07,630 --> 00:04:10,650
我反正是为孩子着想，没别的。
I know,I know. I'm just worried about her. That's all.

77
00:04:11,660 --> 00:04:14,540
Carol的朋友没一个像她这么爱交际。
I mean Carol has never had a friend before who is so social.

78
00:04:14,540 --> 00:04:17,310
Carol已经到了该有点不听话的年龄了，
Well Carol is also at the age when she is going to rebel a little.

79
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:20,690
包括她挑选父母亲不一定赞成的朋友。
And that may include picking some friends her parents might not approve of.

80
00:04:21,250 --> 00:04:23,970
对。Mike的父母亲将会是一种什么样的心情呢？
Think how the parents of Mike's friends must feel.

81
00:04:26,050 --> 00:04:27,430
爸爸妈妈，明天见。
Hey,mum,dad,I'll see you in the morning.

82
00:04:28,570 --> 00:04:29,450
好。
Ok.

83
00:04:29,450 --> 00:04:32,450
明天？啊！
Morning! Wo!

84
00:04:32,650 --> 00:04:33,590
慢着，Mike。
Hold it Mike.

85
00:04:33,990 --> 00:04:34,850
你要去哪？
Where are you going?

86
00:04:35,450 --> 00:04:38,390
波拿刚才来电话说他父母亲今晚不在家
Boner just called,and his parents don't want him home alone tonight cause they're out.

87
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:39,890
所以我去陪他一起过夜。
So I'm gonna go spend the night at his place.

88
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:43,150
你连自己都要人照顾。
You're baby sitting Boner?

89
00:04:43,270 --> 00:04:44,350
可总得有人去啊。
Hey,somebody's got to.

90
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:47,190
这种事你怎么事先不跟我们说？
Mike,shouldn't you tell us these things first?

91
00:04:47,390 --> 00:04:48,470
我刚才不是说了吗？
That's what I just did mum.

92
00:04:49,570 --> 00:04:52,110
不不，这话成了马后炮了。
No,no. That's not how it works.

93
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:58,090
你的意思是说我不能去了？！
Are you guys actually saying that I can't go?

94
00:05:01,330 --> 00:05:02,450
一点不错！
Very good.

95
00:05:03,670 --> 00:05:06,150
爸爸！妈妈你去劝劝他吧！
Dad! Mum,can you talk to him?

96
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:08,810
这是规矩，干任何事都得预先请求。
You know the rules Mike. You have to ask in advance.

97
00:05:09,790 --> 00:05:11,570
求你了！求你了，让我去波拿家吧。
Please Oh please can I go to Boners house?

98
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:14,630
我看今天晚上让你留在家里你会
Maybe staying home tonight will teach you how

99
00:05:14,630 --> 00:05:16,010
知道该怎么做的。
and when to ask for something.

100
00:05:17,970 --> 00:05:20,950
什么？我看你们这样做也太过分了。
I don't. You guys have gone too far this time.

101
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:22,590
我会怎么样？
You know what I'm going to do?

102
00:05:23,710 --> 00:05:26,070
那我事先就告诉你们吧。
I'm going to tell you what I'm going to do.

103
00:05:26,070 --> 00:05:30,350
(stands on his head)

104
00:05:30,350 --> 00:05:33,430
不让我去波拿家，我就一直倒立着。
I'm going to stay like this until you let me go to Boner's house.

105
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:34,330
你们看着办吧。
How do you like that?

106
00:05:34,930 --> 00:05:38,410
这样你可以用充到大脑里的血好好想想。
Well maybe all that blood rushing to your brain will do it some good.

107
00:05:45,930 --> 00:05:47,630
你在干什么我亲爱的哥哥？
What didn't they let you do this time?

108
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:49,230
抗议不让我去波拿家。
Spend the night at Boners.

109
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:55,600
简直难以相信，安妮一块到我们家来了，
I can't believe this. Annie Boyers sleeping at my house,

110
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:59,400
而我这位傻哥哥还一直倒立着。
and my stupid brother is sitting on his head.

111
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:01,670
我就喜欢这么呆着。
Yeah! And I'm going to stay just like this.

112
00:06:01,670 --> 00:06:03,090
妈妈，妈妈……
Mum! Mum!

113
00:06:03,090 --> 00:06:04,930
什么事？又是什么事？
What? What is it?

114
00:06:05,310 --> 00:06:06,050
是他！
It's him.

115
00:06:07,290 --> 00:06:09,070
我什么事也没干，妈妈。
I didn't do anything mum.

116
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:11,450
也许该用橡皮把Carol的房间钉满才是。
Maybe it's time we wallpaper Carol's room in rubber.

117
00:06:12,410 --> 00:06:16,110
我要失陪了，去给波拿打个电话，他会伤心的。
Now if you'll excuse me,I have to call Boner and break my best friends heart.

118
00:06:17,670 --> 00:06:19,630
干嘛让我摊上这么个哥哥。
Why does he have to be related to me?

119
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,810
我为什么没有一个不会让我难堪的兄弟呢。
Why can't I have a normal brother who's not a total embarrassment?

120
00:06:23,810 --> 00:06:26,190
嗨，所以我才出世。
Hey! That's what I'm here for.

121
00:06:28,230 --> 00:06:29,230
很抱歉，波拿，
Boner,look I'm sorry.

122
00:06:29,250 --> 00:06:30,170
我实在不能来了。
I just can't make it alright.

123
00:06:31,590 --> 00:06:33,310
我的家庭需要我。
My family needs me.

124
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,170
好的，让我问问。
Yeah alright. Let me ask.

125
00:06:36,170 --> 00:06:36,690
爸爸？
Hey dad.

126
00:06:42,650 --> 00:06:43,550
你就忙吧。
You're busy.

127
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:45,890
会有办法的，
Yeah Bone,it should be fine.

128
00:06:45,890 --> 00:06:46,570
要是不行我再打电话给你。
I'll call you if there's a problem.

129
00:06:48,130 --> 00:06:48,670
好吧，再见。
Ok bye.

130
00:06:48,670 --> 00:06:50,110
做得很好。尝尝？
These are good. You want one?

131
00:06:50,350 --> 00:06:51,470
不，谢谢爸爸，
No thanks dad.

132
00:06:52,650 --> 00:06:54,030
关于今晚的事情，我想……
Ah about tonight. I'd really..

133
00:06:54,030 --> 00:06:54,530
今晚
About tonight.

134
00:06:55,070 --> 00:06:56,690
你听着，
Would you please do me a favor

135
00:06:56,690 --> 00:06:58,530
希望你今晚上千万别让你妹妹感到尴尬好吗？
and try not to tease your sister tonight,ok?

136
00:07:00,150 --> 00:07:01,000
Carol?

137
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,100
Carol？

138
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:01,200
你有几个妹妹？
Yeah,that sister.

139
00:07:02,090 --> 00:07:03,730
她有了个新朋友，
She's got a new friend,you know.

140
00:07:03,730 --> 00:07:04,890
你就体谅她一下好吗？
So try to be a little sensitive ok?

141
00:07:05,490 --> 00:07:07,870
男人一般都粗线条不会体谅人。
Hey dad,guys are supposed to be tough,not sensitive.

142
00:07:07,870 --> 00:07:10,750
是吗？那么请问艾拉·毛瑞呢？
Oh really? Well then explain Allan Alder?

143
00:07:13,970 --> 00:07:15,030
不知道。
I can't.

144
00:07:17,230 --> 00:07:19,210
我告诉你个小小的秘密，
Let me let you know a little secret Mike.

145
00:07:19,230 --> 00:07:21,610
女人就喜欢体谅人的男人。
Women go crazy for sensitive guys.

146
00:07:21,750 --> 00:07:22,890
你就别骗我了。
Oh come on dad.

147
00:07:23,090 --> 00:07:25,030
还记得那几部著名电影吗？
Yeah,you remember those classic movies

148
00:07:25,030 --> 00:07:26,510
我强迫你去看的？
I bought and I forced you to watch?

149
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:28,620
怎么了？
Yeah.

150
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:29,790
记得卡萨布兰卡？
You remember Casablanca?

151
00:07:29,790 --> 00:07:31,650
有个大舌头老头的那一部？
Yeah with that old guy with the lisp.

152
00:07:32,290 --> 00:07:36,010
他叫柏戈特，最后你母亲和
Bogey,yes. Well do you remember how Carol

153
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:37,670
Carol哭了，你记得吗？
and your mum cried at the end?

154
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:39,870
记得。
Yeah.

155
00:07:39,870 --> 00:07:41,830
她们哭了像其他女人一样，
Well they cried,as all women do,Mike.

156
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:44,390
并不是因为柏戈特是个坚强的人，
Not because Bogey's a tough guy,which he was,

157
00:07:44,930 --> 00:07:46,770
而是因为他很体谅人。
but because he was also sensitive.

158
00:07:48,090 --> 00:07:49,110
体谅人？
Sensitive huh?

159
00:07:50,250 --> 00:07:51,220
嗯。
Uhm!

160
00:07:52,570 --> 00:07:54,470
我是为了你着想，孩子。
Here's looking at you kid.

161
00:07:55,730 --> 00:07:56,370
要多练。
Needs work.

162
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:04,580
（门铃响）
(door bell)

163
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:05,910
再见妈妈再见爸爸，回头见。
Bye mum! Bye dad! See you later.

164
00:08:05,910 --> 00:08:06,990
Carol，等一下。
Carol,wait!

165
00:08:07,830 --> 00:08:09,100
Hi Carol.

166
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:12,950
这就是我母亲，安妮。妈妈，这就是安妮。
Annie,this is my mum. Mum This is Annie.

167
00:08:13,610 --> 00:08:15,470
很高兴见到你。Jason……
Nice to meet you Annie. Jason!

168
00:08:15,650 --> 00:08:16,670
我也很高兴。
Thanks. You too.

169
00:08:17,150 --> 00:08:18,650
这是我的小弟弟BEN。
And this is my little brother,Ben.

170
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:20,590
又带了衣服给Carol吗？
Did you bring more clothes for Carol?

171
00:08:21,690 --> 00:08:21,970
Ben!

172
00:08:21,970 --> 00:08:24,090
没关系，这样的弟弟我也有。
It's Ok. I have a little brother too.

173
00:08:24,910 --> 00:08:26,110
这是我的父亲。
And this is my father.

174
00:08:26,250 --> 00:08:26,730
HI，安妮，
Hi Annie.

175
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:28,560
Hi.

176
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:30,690
我很高兴见到帮Carol涂脂抹粉的艺术家。
Well it's nice to meet the artist who painted Carols face.

177
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:33,770
爸爸！
Dad!

178
00:08:33,770 --> 00:08:36,070
没关系，这样的爸爸我也有。呵呵。
It's Ok. I have a father too.

179
00:08:36,070 --> 00:08:37,250
(cough)

180
00:08:37,250 --> 00:08:38,090
这是Mike。
And that's Mike.

181
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,130
Hi.

182
00:08:40,130 --> 00:08:41,050
回头见，Mike。
See you later Mike.

183
00:08:41,710 --> 00:08:44,190
好，回头见。我得去换一套衣服，
Oh,yeah right! I have to go out and change.

184
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:45,910
因为刚才我在摆弄保时捷牌轿车。
I was just in the garage fixing the Porsche.

185
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:50,010
我们没有保时捷牌轿车。
Mike,we don't have a Porsche.

186
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:54,700
啊，对，保时捷、法拉力谁能分得清呢。
Ah right! Porsche,Ferrari,who can keep them straight.

187
00:08:54,830 --> 00:08:57,050
来，这几件挺帅的套衫你试试。
Come on Carol. I brought over a couple of hot sweaters I want you to try.

188
00:08:57,450 --> 00:08:58,330
好极了！
Oh,great!

189
00:09:00,410 --> 00:09:02,670
我看今晚你们就呆在家吧。
So you guys can just hang around here tonight.

190
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:05,530
妈妈！
Mum!

191
00:09:06,070 --> 00:09:08,970
穿这件你真是太性感了！
This one makes you look so sexy.

192
00:09:10,230 --> 00:09:10,290
真的？！
Really?

193
00:09:10,290 --> 00:09:11,610
你还想干些什么？
What do you want to do tonight?

194
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,500
不是说好逛商店吗？
Well I thought we were going to the mall?

195
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:15,210
可今天下午已经逛了。
Well we just did that this afternoon.

196
00:09:15,210 --> 00:09:16,530
去西柏莱斯商店看看。
Well we could see something at the Six Blacks?

197
00:09:16,850 --> 00:09:17,650
你想看什么？
Anything you want to see?

198
00:09:17,690 --> 00:09:18,370
随便看看。
Not really.

199
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:18,810
我也是。
Me neither.

200
00:09:18,950 --> 00:09:19,830
其实都看过。
I've seen them all.

201
00:09:20,110 --> 00:09:20,410
我也是。
Me too.

202
00:09:20,470 --> 00:09:21,230
还上哪？
Well,where else?

203
00:09:21,770 --> 00:09:22,470
我不知道。
I don't know.

204
00:09:22,970 --> 00:09:24,010
我也不知道。
I don't know either.

205
00:09:24,010 --> 00:09:24,530
我看就别出去了。
We don't have to go out.

206
00:09:24,530 --> 00:09:25,470
你是说呆在这？
You mean stay here?

207
00:09:25,470 --> 00:09:26,070
是啊。
We could.

208
00:09:26,110 --> 00:09:26,650
呆一晚？
For the night?

209
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:27,850
那不挺有趣吗？
Hey that would be fun.

210
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:29,530
对，哈哈。
Yeah!

211
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:32,830
Carol该有自己的朋友，
Carol's going to have her own friends

212
00:09:32,830 --> 00:09:35,230
我们不必操心，除非有这个必要。
and we shouldn't worry unless there's something to worry about.

213
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:39,230
你和我意见一致的时候总显得那么聪明。
You sound so smart when you agree with me.

214
00:09:39,990 --> 00:09:42,050
你别太得意了。
Don't push your luck.

215
00:09:42,050 --> 00:09:42,830
糖蜡大虾？
Sweet and sour shrimp?

216
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:45,370
我尝尝。
Oh,is that for me?

217
00:09:45,370 --> 00:09:52,090
味道不错。
(spits it out) It's good.

218
00:09:52,090 --> 00:09:54,050
这怎么可能呢。
Ah,this can't be.

219
00:09:54,050 --> 00:09:56,010
我是严格按照菜谱做的，
You know I followed that recipe to the letter.

220
00:09:56,130 --> 00:09:58,470
水珠子跳得简直就像芭蕾舞演员一样。
I had water dancing like Baryshnikov here.

221
00:09:59,490 --> 00:10:01,850
也许该用糖时你却用了盐。
Honey. I think you used salt instead of sugar.

222
00:10:03,070 --> 00:10:04,460
这绝不可能。
Well that's impossible.

223
00:10:04,460 --> 00:10:04,870
这也没关系。
Well that's ok.

224
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:06,610
每个人都可能这样。
I mean it could happen to anybody.

225
00:10:07,050 --> 00:10:09,250
因为盐和糖看上去好象差不多。
It looks exactly alike. It's an easy mistake.

226
00:10:10,090 --> 00:10:11,750
你也经常搞错。呵。
So you've done it too,huh?

227
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:13,750
你就别逗了。
You've got to be kidding.

228
00:10:19,130 --> 00:10:21,010
你还是穿这种颜色好看。
This color would look good on you

229
00:10:21,130 --> 00:10:22,950
比不上穿在你身上好看。
Not as good as it looks on you.

230
00:10:22,990 --> 00:10:23,990
我看不见的。
Not true.

231
00:10:24,110 --> 00:10:26,750
老实说你穿任何一件都好看。
Let's face it. All these look better on you.

232
00:10:27,710 --> 00:10:29,930
Carol，我和爸爸去中国餐馆
Carol! Your father and I are getting some Chinese take out,

233
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:31,130
买几个菜回来。
from wok around the clock.

234
00:10:32,130 --> 00:10:33,330
爸爸不是烧饭了吗？
I thought dad was..

235
00:10:33,330 --> 00:10:35,930
是烧了。帮我布置餐桌好吗？
He was. Would you set the table for me please?

236
00:10:36,130 --> 00:10:40,070
好的。你在这里呆一晚肯定不介意吗？
Sure. Are you sure you don't mind hanging out here all evening?

237
00:10:41,410 --> 00:10:42,110
不。
No!

238
00:10:42,110 --> 00:10:47,520
女士们。
Ladies.

239
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:48,650
Hi!

240
00:10:48,650 --> 00:10:48,750
HI。

241
00:10:48,750 --> 00:10:49,310
你有什么事吗？
what do you want?

242
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:53,110
什么事也没有，我来呼吸一点新鲜空气。
Ah,not a thing. I was just out for a fresh of breath air.

243
00:10:57,550 --> 00:10:59,110
OH，你这衣服真美，安妮。
Vicious sweater Annie.

244
00:10:59,290 --> 00:11:02,150
谢谢。听到男士的赞赏很高兴。
Thanks. It's nice to have a boy's point of view.

245
00:11:02,630 --> 00:11:04,110
对，可不是吗，
Yeah,well,that's me.

246
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:07,210
我是男士，
All boy.

247
00:11:07,350 --> 00:11:09,250
是个地道的男子汉。
Some might even say a man.

248
00:11:10,430 --> 00:11:13,350
甚至称得上是体谅人的男子汉。
Some might even say a sensitive man.

249
00:11:14,790 --> 00:11:17,610
你的话甚至使我马上就在呕吐了。
Some might even say I'm gonna puke on my shoes.

250
00:11:19,250 --> 00:11:21,350
我很喜欢你这身衣服。
I like your outfit too.

251
00:11:22,300 --> 00:11:23,730
哈哈，这个。
This?

252
00:11:23,730 --> 00:11:26,750
当·约翰逊每个月都要给我送点料子来，
Well Don Johnson sends me these test clothes every month,

253
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:27,550
要我批准。
for my approval.

254
00:11:28,810 --> 00:11:31,250
我看这料子可以评为一等。
I guess I'll give these a thumbs up.

255
00:11:32,370 --> 00:11:36,540
Mike，你的鼻子里有东西出来了。
Ah Mike. There's something hanging from your nose.

256
00:11:39,710 --> 00:11:42,130
Carol，我觉得你显然是希望我离开这，
Cool. I get the distinct feeling that you want me to leave.

257
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:44,290
如果真是这样，你就直说，
If you do,just say the word and I'll go.

258
00:11:46,150 --> 00:11:47,470
我会的。
I want you to know,

259
00:11:47,530 --> 00:11:50,410
我要告诉你你告诉别对他客气，别因为他是我的哥哥。
you don't have to be nice to Mike just because he's my brother.

260
00:11:51,540 --> 00:11:52,590
好吧。
Ok.

261
00:11:52,590 --> 00:11:53,660
我去布置餐桌。
I'm got to go set the table.

262
00:11:53,660 --> 00:11:55,180
我换身衣服马上下来。
I'm going to change. I'll be right down.

263
00:11:55,180 --> 00:11:56,170
好的。
Ok.

264
00:11:57,210 --> 00:12:02,150
莎莉，我在哪里你猜猜看。
(phone call) Sherry! Guess where I am?

265
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:05,310
我在Seaver家。对，Mike Seaver。
The Seavers. Yes,and Mike's here.

266
00:12:05,310 --> 00:12:06,810
我想他喜欢我。
I think he likes me.

267
00:12:07,170 --> 00:12:09,170
他换了衣服还梳了头，
Well he changed his clothes and combed his hair.

268
00:12:10,110 --> 00:12:13,610
Carol她一点也没有怀疑。
No,Carol doesn't suspect a thing.

269
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:22,510
快来，Maggie。
Come on Maggie.

270
00:12:23,070 --> 00:12:24,390
我马上就来。
I'll be there in a minute.

271
00:12:25,970 --> 00:12:28,770
Mike,Mike，我错了，
Mike,Mike Mike. I was wrong.

272
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:30,710
今晚你应该到波拿家去，
You should spend the night at Boners.

273
00:12:31,370 --> 00:12:32,530
现在就走。
And leave now.

274
00:12:33,010 --> 00:12:34,990
可是妈妈，几时才能温习这该死的功课呢
Hey mum. How am I ever going to learn that darn lesson,

275
00:12:34,990 --> 00:12:36,430
我要是出门，
if I don't stay here tonight?

276
00:12:36,990 --> 00:12:39,530
今晚我不认为你该温习什么了。
Well I don't want you learning any more this evening.

277
00:12:39,930 --> 00:12:42,850
我认为你该去照顾你那位朋友。
I think you should go. Go and baby-sit your friend.

278
00:12:43,300 --> 00:12:44,310
是的，但是妈妈。
Yeah but mum!

279
00:12:44,310 --> 00:12:45,770
谢谢你Seaver太太。
Hello,thanks Mrs Seaver.

280
00:12:45,770 --> 00:12:46,390
波拿。
Boner!

281
00:12:46,390 --> 00:12:47,090
Mike你好。
Yo Mikey!

282
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:48,650
妈妈！
Mum!

283
00:12:48,830 --> 00:12:50,270
波拿你来这干嘛？
Boner,what are you doing here?

284
00:12:50,810 --> 00:12:52,070
我父母不准我一个人过夜，
Well my folks didn't want me to spend the night alone,

285
00:12:52,070 --> 00:12:53,550
我来问Mike来这行吗？
so I asked Mikey if I could stay over.

286
00:12:54,130 --> 00:12:55,730
他没告诉你？
He didn't ask.

287
00:12:57,210 --> 00:12:58,410
不，他没有。
No! He didn't.

288
00:12:59,010 --> 00:13:01,230
不错，我没说，我知道说了会怎么样，
No,no,I didn't ask him. We all know what that means.

289
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,370
肯定不会答应，
No asking no getting.

290
00:13:03,130 --> 00:13:04,470
这样的教训我有过。
I'm only going to learn the hard way.

291
00:13:04,470 --> 00:13:05,850
波拿老兄你得走。
Boner,my friend,you'll have to go.

292
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:08,170
噢，别走，我们都是凡人，
Oh no. But we're all human mike.

293
00:13:08,170 --> 00:13:09,510
总有忘记什么的时候
We all forget things.

294
00:13:09,810 --> 00:13:10,850
干嘛让你这无辜的朋友
I mean why should your

295
00:13:10,850 --> 00:13:13,590
为我一时的糊涂而受罪呢？
innocent friend suffer,on account of saving me?

296
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,910
没什么关系，波拿受得了。
That's ok. Boner's tough.

297
00:13:15,910 --> 00:13:16,750
不，我受不了。
No I'm not.

298
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:18,910
Mike！我不让他走。
Mike,I insist.

299
00:13:19,430 --> 00:13:22,590
波拿，请你留下来让我们款待你，
Boner,please stay and enjoy the Seaver hospitality.

300
00:13:22,590 --> 00:13:25,470
做点游戏，看看电视，不会让你干坐着。
Watch TV,play games,keep each other busy.

301
00:13:25,950 --> 00:13:27,270
Maggie，你干嘛拉着他？
Maggie,what holding you up?

302
00:13:27,270 --> 00:13:29,130
咱们走，Jason，今晚还有事呢。
Let's go Jason. We don't have all night.

303
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:35,150
于是我哭了，我爸爸问我什么事
So,I was crying,and my dad said "what's wrong?"

304
00:13:35,230 --> 00:13:36,830
可我不好意思告诉他。
I was too embarrassed to tell him.

305
00:13:36,950 --> 00:13:37,710
为了什么事？
Well what was it?

306
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:38,950
为了电视。
Something on TV.

307
00:13:39,130 --> 00:13:40,970
不说了，你会笑话我的。
I don't want to tell you. You'll think I'm a ditz.

308
00:13:41,050 --> 00:13:41,870
不，我不会的。
No I won't.

309
00:13:42,490 --> 00:13:43,510
你保证不会笑？
Promise you won't laugh?

310
00:13:43,590 --> 00:13:44,350
我保证不会。
I promise.

311
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:49,410
好吧。我看了告别亲人飞向远方的电视。
Ok. It was one of those long distance commercials.

312
00:13:49,410 --> 00:13:51,510
那可不，我看了也会哭的。
Are you kidding? They make me cry too.

313
00:13:51,510 --> 00:13:53,170
他们没有！你在笑话我？哪个？
They do not! Are you kidding me? Which one?

314
00:13:53,210 --> 00:13:53,850
父亲和儿子。
The Father and the son.

315
00:13:53,850 --> 00:13:55,430
就是这个我也会哭的。
Yes,that's the one I was crying about.

316
00:13:55,530 --> 00:13:56,670
我觉得自己很愚蠢。
I feel so stupid,yep.

317
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:59,330
必须告诉Carol，因为她该知道。
And we have to tell Carol,because she has to know.

318
00:13:59,630 --> 00:14:00,610
可又不能告诉Carol，
But we can't tell Carol,

319
00:14:00,610 --> 00:14:02,250
因为说了她会非常伤心的。
because it would break Carol's heart if we tell her,

320
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,810
现在你明白我的意思了？
but we know she should know. Yes or no? You know?

321
00:14:04,810 --> 00:14:05,890
我非常清醒。
Believe it or not,I do.

322
00:14:06,670 --> 00:14:08,670
对安妮的看法我比你准。
I was right about Annie all along. You see?

323
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:12,210
现在可不是我们讨论谁是谁非的时候。
Oh,this is no time to talk about whose right or wrong.

324
00:14:12,530 --> 00:14:14,330
我对的时候你总这样做。
Why do you only say that when I'm right?

325
00:14:15,190 --> 00:14:17,370
我们先把熟菜买回来
Look. After we pick up dinner,then we'll come back,

326
00:14:17,550 --> 00:14:18,670
再去警告Mike当心安妮。
we'll warn Mike about Annie.

327
00:14:18,830 --> 00:14:20,930
到那时候也许能想出个办法来。
By then,maybe we'll have figured out a way to break it to Carol.

328
00:14:20,930 --> 00:14:22,050
我们现在不能走。
We can't go now.

329
00:14:22,230 --> 00:14:24,430
行了，Maggie，只离开几分钟，
Oh Maggie,it's a minute there,a minute back.

330
00:14:24,470 --> 00:14:25,690
什么事也不会发生的。
Nothing will happen.

331
00:14:26,070 --> 00:14:27,810
特别是有波拿在这。
Especially with Boner there.

332
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:37,310
Mike，快让我进去。
Mikey. Come on,let me in.

333
00:14:37,590 --> 00:14:39,170
波拿，如果你真是我的朋友
Boner,look. If you're really my friend,

334
00:14:39,590 --> 00:14:40,610
你就去艾迪家。
then you'll go spend the night at Eddies.

335
00:14:40,610 --> 00:14:42,290
艾迪今晚有朋友。
Eddie's got a date tonight.

336
00:14:42,810 --> 00:14:46,200
Mike，至少让我进去把睡袋拿出来。
Come on Mike. You'll at least let me in to get my sleeping bag.

337
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:49,490
好吧，可只给你一秒钟。
Alright,alright. But just for a second.

338
00:14:49,490 --> 00:14:53,350
你这样对待我是因为你那妞？
This is so that you can make the moves on that chick,huh?

339
00:14:53,390 --> 00:14:54,510
当然不是。
Of course not.

340
00:14:55,030 --> 00:14:56,270
这样做太不漂亮了。
You know Mike,this is totally uncool.

341
00:14:56,430 --> 00:15:01,450
她是你妹妹的朋友。哗。
She's your sister's friend and ...oh wow!

342
00:15:03,190 --> 00:15:04,070
想说话？
You were saying?

343
00:15:04,530 --> 00:15:05,850
Mike留波拿吃晚饭吗？
Mike is Boner staying for dinner?

344
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:08,570
不，
Ah,no,no. Actually,

345
00:15:08,570 --> 00:15:10,310
他现在就走，去艾迪家过夜。
he's leaving right now to go spend the night at Eddie's house.

346
00:15:11,020 --> 00:15:12,130
你非去不可吗？
You're sure you can't get out of it.

347
00:15:12,130 --> 00:15:13,370
对，对，你要是不去，艾迪会很失望的。
Yeah,Eddie gets real disappointed. But thanks for stopping over,

348
00:15:13,370 --> 00:15:14,350
谢谢你，星期一学校见。
and I'll see you in school on Monday.

349
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:18,670
Carol，你先去试试那件紫红的，
Carol,go ahead and try on the peach blouse I brought.

350
00:15:18,810 --> 00:15:19,850
我忘了拿筷子了。
I forgot the chopsticks.

351
00:15:20,420 --> 00:15:22,830
好吧。爸爸妈妈回来就叫我们。
Ok! Call us when mum and dad get back. Ok?

352
00:15:22,830 --> 00:15:24,350
当然可以，没问题。
Yeah,sure,fine,no problem.

353
00:15:28,770 --> 00:15:30,230
这种筷子好吗？
Are these the good chopsticks?

354
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:33,290
是我们家最好的。
Ah,best we have.

355
00:15:33,290 --> 00:15:38,740
安妮，你这件很漂亮的
Ah Annie,that blue thing you have on there,

356
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:40,080
蓝的东西叫什么？
it's nice. What do you call it?

357
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,610
套衫。
Sweater.

358
00:15:41,610 --> 00:15:43,750
很好，看上去很帅。
Ah good. That's catchy.

359
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:46,110
恐怕，它和我的耳环不配。
I'm not that this one goes with my earrings though.

360
00:15:46,620 --> 00:15:47,770
耳环？
Ah,earrings?

361
00:15:47,770 --> 00:15:50,270
瞧，觉得怎么样？
Here,tell me what you see?

362
00:15:52,710 --> 00:15:54,110
对对，耳环挺好看。
Yeah,yeah,those are earrings alright.

363
00:15:55,060 --> 00:15:57,300
跟我的套衫配不配？
But do they go with my sweater?

364
00:15:57,410 --> 00:15:58,570
当然配。
Oh,oh definitely.

365
00:15:59,130 --> 00:16:00,130
你肯定？
Are you sure?

366
00:16:00,870 --> 00:16:04,640
为了肯定，让我再看一下。
Ah,well,just to be sure,let me double check.

367
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:19,540
我是希望今晚应该像这样。
Wow! I was hoping this night would end up like this.

368
00:16:19,810 --> 00:16:21,030
Carol会回来的。
Yeah,but Carol might come back.

369
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:22,470
别管Carol。
Forget Carol.

370
00:16:23,190 --> 00:16:25,160
你还真干脆！
Ah,I like your style.

371
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:25,780
安妮？
Annie!

372
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:26,420
Carol!

373
00:16:26,420 --> 00:16:26,520
Carol！

374
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:27,250
Hey Carol!

375
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:27,920
OH，Mike，

376
00:16:28,610 --> 00:16:30,790
很好。咱们谈谈。
Oh my god,we have to talk.

377
00:16:31,180 --> 00:16:32,450
是吗？
Yeah!

378
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:33,790
这事令人吃惊。
Now I know this is shocking,

379
00:16:34,350 --> 00:16:37,390
安妮在利用Carol，她感兴趣的是你。
but Annie is using Carol because she's interested in you.

380
00:16:37,930 --> 00:16:39,710
不！
No!

381
00:16:40,710 --> 00:16:42,390
是这样。我听见她打电话了，
Yes,I heard her on the phone

382
00:16:42,390 --> 00:16:44,290
我想先警告你，免得出问题。
and I wanted to warn you before anything happened,

383
00:16:44,290 --> 00:16:47,210
这种事情会使Carol很痛苦。
because something like this could devastate Carol.

384
00:16:47,590 --> 00:16:49,890
对，这我知道，
Yeah. I mean yeah!

385
00:16:50,170 --> 00:16:51,850
我看今晚我还是
You know,probably the best thing would be for me

386
00:16:51,850 --> 00:16:53,070
到波拿家去过夜吧。
to go over to Boner's right now.

387
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:54,620
好极了。
Great!

388
00:16:56,210 --> 00:16:56,990
再见，爸爸。
Hey see you dad.

389
00:16:57,090 --> 00:16:57,710
你要去哪？
Where are you going?

390
00:16:58,070 --> 00:16:58,570
去波拿家。
Boner's house.

391
00:16:59,130 --> 00:16:59,930
什么？
What?

392
00:16:59,930 --> 00:17:00,190
是妈妈的主意。
Mum's idea.

393
00:17:00,190 --> 00:17:01,730
这究竟是怎么回事。
Don't give me that.

394
00:17:04,270 --> 00:17:06,930
Carol，快开门。求你了！
Carol! Open the door. Please?

395
00:17:07,650 --> 00:17:09,690
不！永远不出来，永远！
No. I'm never coming out. Ever.

396
00:17:11,330 --> 00:17:13,090
也许不喜欢试穿的衣服。
She's trying on a skirt she doesn't like.

397
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:16,310
哦……
OoooK!

398
00:17:17,190 --> 00:17:18,730
Carol，真对不起。
Carol,I'm sorry.

399
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:20,710
你给我走开。
Go away!

400
00:17:25,530 --> 00:17:27,730
Carol，中国菜有了。
Carol! Chinese food.

401
00:17:28,630 --> 00:17:30,850
中国菜中国菜，
Chinese food,Chinese food.

402
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:33,850
你真的要我吃中国菜吗？
You expect me to eat Chinese food?

403
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:43,510
好吧。
OoooK!

404
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:52,390
晚饭马上就要上桌了。
Dinner will be on the table in a minute.

405
00:17:52,550 --> 00:17:54,070
记住，在远方。
Remember long distance.

406
00:17:54,770 --> 00:17:57,070
哦。
Ohh!(sobbing)

407
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:58,500
朋友是至关重要的。
When a friend really matters.

408
00:17:58,500 --> 00:18:01,090
我该和Carol谈谈。
I got to go talk to Carol.

409
00:18:01,330 --> 00:18:03,370
别提什么中国菜。
Don't mention Chinese food.

410
00:18:04,330 --> 00:18:07,150
我该出去了。
I got to go outside.

411
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:11,390
这些人都不对劲了。
I'm surrounded by loons.

412
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:14,270
波拿。
Boner!

413
00:18:14,270 --> 00:18:16,490
Mike。我什么人也不打扰，
Mikey,I won't bother nobody.

414
00:18:16,650 --> 00:18:17,770
就睡在这。
I'll just stay right here.

415
00:18:18,730 --> 00:18:19,710
波拿，我吻了安妮。
Boner I kissed Annie.

416
00:18:20,830 --> 00:18:23,150
好家伙，真是太有意思了。
Oh man! That's fantastic.

417
00:18:23,710 --> 00:18:25,900
你疯了，这太可怕了。
What are you nuts? It's horrible.

418
00:18:26,030 --> 00:18:27,650
你不是一心想这样吗？
But I thought that's what you were after?

419
00:18:28,350 --> 00:18:31,130
波拿，我把妹妹的朋友当目标，这也算神气。
Boner,hitting on your sisters best friend is totally uncool.

420
00:18:31,690 --> 00:18:32,890
你怎么想的？
Where have you been?

421
00:18:32,890 --> 00:18:36,510
Carol看到了就奔上楼去了。
Boner,Carol saw us and she ran upstairs crying.

422
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:41,830
怎么回事？
Oh! So how was it?

423
00:18:42,230 --> 00:18:43,110
指的是什么？
How was what?

424
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:44,310
你说的吻？
You know. The kiss.

425
00:18:46,630 --> 00:18:49,450
我可不是那种吻一下就到处乱说的人。
Well,I'm not one to kiss and tell Boner,

426
00:18:49,530 --> 00:18:51,890
私下说吧，
but just between you and me,

427
00:18:51,890 --> 00:18:53,590
我觉得她还挺那个的。
it was pretty hot.

428
00:18:54,090 --> 00:18:57,670
哗，学一个？
Wow! Show me.

429
00:19:01,450 --> 00:19:03,870
我真傻，没想到你这样的人
I was so stupid to think that somebody like you

430
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:04,870
会交我这个朋友。
would want to be my friend.

431
00:19:05,030 --> 00:19:06,450
可我是你的朋友。
I am your friend.

432
00:19:06,870 --> 00:19:08,350
安妮，我一点也不傻，
Annie,I'm not stupid.

433
00:19:08,940 --> 00:19:10,690
我的平均名次是4.0
I've a four point zero grade average;

434
00:19:10,690 --> 00:19:11,510
我还是象棋小组成员，
I'm a member of the chess club,

435
00:19:11,510 --> 00:19:14,230
又是美国未来核物理家协会主席。
and president of the Future Nuclear Physicists of America.

436
00:19:15,810 --> 00:19:17,830
我知道你干嘛来了。
I know why you're here.

437
00:19:21,250 --> 00:19:23,190
你说得对。
Ok,you're right.

438
00:19:23,190 --> 00:19:25,290
可我发誓我真的也喜欢你。
But I really like you too. I swear.

439
00:19:26,230 --> 00:19:29,930
电视使我感动的事我从来都没有对任何人说过。
I never told anybody about those long distance commercials before.

440
00:19:31,170 --> 00:19:33,130
我知道我犯下了一个大错误，
Carol,this is the worst thing I've ever done.

441
00:19:33,670 --> 00:19:35,950
即使你永远恨我我永远也不怪你。
If you hate me forever,I don't blame you.

442
00:19:36,790 --> 00:19:37,750
那好，我恨你。
Fine,I will.

443
00:19:41,310 --> 00:19:43,450
不过我还有一个问题。
Just one question though.

444
00:19:43,610 --> 00:19:46,130
你说吧。只要我能够弥补就行。
What? Anything to make it up to you.

445
00:19:47,030 --> 00:19:48,410
为什么找Mike？！
Why Mike?

446
00:19:50,570 --> 00:19:51,770
他挺帅！
He's cute.

447
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:54,530
笑话。
Yuk!

448
00:19:55,170 --> 00:19:56,370
可他吻起来比谁都笨。
But he can't kiss for a doodlely.

449
00:19:59,430 --> 00:20:02,130
你这样说是想让我好过一点。
You're just saying that to make me feel better.

450
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:05,390
对，是这样。
Yeah,I am.

451
00:20:08,670 --> 00:20:11,830
Carol一定发现安妮的用意了。
Somehow Carol must have found out what Annie was up to.

452
00:20:13,710 --> 00:20:15,850
咱们快上楼看看。
Well we'd better get up there and check on them.

453
00:20:15,990 --> 00:20:17,690
我本来就是那样说的。
That's what I've been saying all along.

454
00:20:17,830 --> 00:20:18,690
你同意了？
So you agree?

455
00:20:18,870 --> 00:20:20,550
我说的当然同意。
Of course I agree. I said it.

456
00:20:20,750 --> 00:20:22,910
Jason，现在不是讨论归功谁的问题。
Jason,this is no time to be claiming credit.

457
00:20:29,260 --> 00:20:31,190
Carol!

458
00:20:31,190 --> 00:20:31,290
Carol？

459
00:20:31,290 --> 00:20:33,040
宝贝，你没事吧？
Sweetheart,are you Ok?

460
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:35,560
(Noise of squealing)

461
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,690
Jason，她俩都疯了。
Oh Jason,they are both hysterical.

462
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,550
Carol，安妮？
Carol! Annie!

463
00:20:40,330 --> 00:20:43,770
我知道，爸爸，又是中国菜。
I know dad,Chinese food.

464
00:20:46,290 --> 00:20:48,070
我对你说过没必要上来。
Told you there was no reason to come up here.

465
00:20:51,130 --> 00:20:52,830
我不想伤任何人的心。
I didn't mean to hurt anybody.

466
00:20:53,610 --> 00:20:55,790
女人迷上了我，难道能怪我吗？
Is it my fault that women find me irresistible?

467
00:20:56,530 --> 00:20:57,430
那是你的不幸。
It's a curse.

468
00:20:58,190 --> 00:21:01,770
那个大舌头的男人会怎么说？
Now,what would that sensitive guy with the lisp say?

469
00:21:02,550 --> 00:21:04,110
他会说，我很抱歉。
I guess he's say "I'm thorry".

470
00:21:06,970 --> 00:21:10,470
明白了。Carol，安妮，
I got it. Hey Carol,Annie,

471
00:21:10,730 --> 00:21:11,830
能和你们谈一分钟吗？
can I talk to you both for a minute?

472
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:14,030
Uh hu.

473
00:21:14,030 --> 00:21:14,720
好。
Yeah.

474
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:17,530
好吧，听我说，今晚发生了很多事情，
Alright. Now a great many things have happened to us tonight,

475
00:21:17,530 --> 00:21:20,850
我知道该为咱们仨好好考虑一下了。
and I know that I have to do the thinking for all of us.

476
00:21:21,190 --> 00:21:22,170
考虑什么Mike？
What is it Mike?

477
00:21:22,850 --> 00:21:26,030
这样说吧，我可不会说什么高雅的话，
Alright,look! I'm no good at being noble Carol. But,

478
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:30,030
即使不是天才也能看得出三个年轻人的问题
it doesn't take much to see that the problems of three little people,

479
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:31,790
不等于一大堆豆子。
don't amount to a hill of beans.

480
00:21:33,950 --> 00:21:36,510
对，请你们一定要记住，
Yeah,now you guys must remember this.

481
00:21:36,910 --> 00:21:38,710
吻不过就是个吻。
A kiss is just a kiss.

482
00:21:39,670 --> 00:21:42,200
Mike，还要说多久？
Mike,is this going to take long?

483
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:44,760
好吧，问题在于，
Alright look. The point is...

484
00:21:45,410 --> 00:21:49,090
安妮，我很抱歉，对你吻没恶意。
Annie I'm sorry,but it can never be for us.

485
00:21:49,580 --> 00:21:53,870
Carol，对你也很抱歉，我吻了安妮。
And Carol,I'm really sorry that I kissed Annie.

486
00:21:53,870 --> 00:21:54,950
这事就别提了。
Forget about it Mike.

487
00:21:55,090 --> 00:21:56,710
对，那没什么。
Yeah,it was nothing.

488
00:22:04,710 --> 00:22:06,230
那没什么？
It was nothing?

489
00:22:07,710 --> 00:22:09,230
这事就别提了？
Forget about it?

490
00:22:10,390 --> 00:22:12,070
那干嘛还要哭哭啼啼的？
Hey,what about the tears?

491
00:22:12,710 --> 00:22:13,870
还那么伤心？
The heartbreak?

492
00:22:14,170 --> 00:22:15,770
吻一下又怎么样？
Hey what about my kiss?

493
00:22:16,250 --> 00:22:18,170
有什么大惊小怪的？
What about Alan Alder?

494
00:22:22,870 --> 00:22:24,410
（电视）我很抱歉，姑娘。
"Here's looking at you kid"

495
00:22:28,710 --> 00:22:30,930
这个大舌头的人挺好。
That guy with the lisp is good.

496
00:22:32,570 --> 00:22:34,410
你快看，她哭了。
Would you look at that. She's crying.

497
00:22:35,430 --> 00:22:37,110
我真不明白，我做错什么了？
I don't get it. What was I doing wrong?

498
00:22:39,490 --> 00:22:40,690
再放一遍，BEN。
Play it again Ben.
